  "sketch": "// Potentiometer: pins 1->5V, 3->GND, wiper (2)->A0\n// LED brightness controlled by potentiometer on D9\nconst int potPin = A0;\nconst int ledPin = 9;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(ledPin, OUTPUT);\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  int potValue = analogRead(potPin);\n  int brightness = map(potValue, 0, 1023, 0, 255);\n  analogWrite(ledPin, brightness);\n\n  Serial.print(\"Pot: \");\n  Serial.print(potValue);\n  Serial.print(\" -> Brightness: \");\n  Serial.println(brightness);\n  delay(50);\n}\n",
